{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Welcome to MkDocs","text":"<ul> <li>Karibu API Documentation</li> </ul>"},{"location":"#documentation-link","title":"Documentation link","text":"<ul> <li>Animal feeding</li> <li>Fresh OIl</li> <li>Godown</li> <li>User</li> <li>Printing</li> <li>Hardware</li> <li>Stationery</li> </ul>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/","title":"Index","text":""},{"location":"animalfeeding/#animal-feeding-api-doc","title":"Animal Feeding API doc","text":""},{"location":"animalfeeding/#create","title":"Create","text":""},{"location":"animalfeeding/#add-product","title":"Add product","text":"<ul> <li>endpoint , request body, sample, response status, response body.</li> <li> <p>This end point helps an admin to add a product into the store and requires authentication.</p> </li> <li> <p>Endpoint - <code>api/v1/animal-feeding/products</code> |</p> </li> <li> <p>request body:</p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>{\n \"name\": \"lezod\",\n\"description\": \"chakula cha ngombwe ambao wamezaliwa\",\n\"quantity\": 20,\n\"price\": 50000,\n\"image\": \"/uploads/image-1776795374292-8855409.jpg\",\n\"userId\": \"69e76562713885bf5dbbe900\",\n\"nutrients\": \"vitamin\",\n}\n</code></pre> <ul> <li>response body:</li> </ul> <pre><code>{\n    \"message\": \"Product created successfully\",\n    \"product\": {\n        \"name\": \"lezod\",\n        \"description\": \"chakula cha ngombwe ambao wamezaliwa\",\n        \"quantity\": 20,\n        \"price\": 50000,\n        \"image\": \"/uploads/image-1776795374292-8855409.jpg\",\n        \"userId\": \"69e76562713885bf5dbbe900\",\n        \"nutrients\": \"vitamin\",\n        \"_id\": \"69e7beee9e15259fba95973d\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:16:14.355Z\",\n        \"updatedAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:16:14.355Z\",\n        \"total\": 1000000,\n        \"__v\": 0\n    }\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#create-an-order","title":"Create an order","text":"<ul> <li>endpoint , request body, sample, response status, response body.</li> <li> <p>This end point helps an user into the system to create an order based on the product which is available into the system.</p> </li> <li> <p>Endpoint - <code>http://localhost:4000/api/v1/animal-feeding/orders</code> |</p> </li> <li> <p>request body:</p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>{\n    \"productId\": \"69e7beee9e15259fba95973d\",\n    \"quantity\": 1,\n    \"productName\" : \"lezod\"\n}\n</code></pre> <ul> <li>response body:</li> </ul> <pre><code>{\n    \"message\": \"Order created successfully\",\n    \"order\": {\n        \"productName\": \"lezod\",\n        \"productId\": \"69e7beee9e15259fba95973d\",\n        \"quantity\": 1,\n        \"price\": 50000,\n        \"total\": 50000,\n        \"userId\": \"69e76562713885bf5dbbe900\",\n        \"_id\": \"69e7c1327a501a5133538ebf\",\n        \"orderId\": \"ORDER-ANIMAL-FEEDING-1776795954751-2252\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:25:54.762Z\",\n        \"updatedAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:25:54.762Z\",\n        \"__v\": 0\n    }\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#read","title":"Read","text":""},{"location":"animalfeeding/#get-products","title":"Get products","text":"<ul> <li> <p>endpoint: <code>http://localhost:4000/api/v1/animal-feeding/products/</code></p> </li> <li> <p>response: </p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>[\n    {\n        \"_id\": \"69e7beee9e15259fba95973d\",\n        \"name\": \"lezod\",\n        \"description\": \"chakula cha ngombwe ambao wamezaliwa\",\n        \"quantity\": 18,\n        \"price\": 50000,\n        \"image\": \"/uploads/image-1776795374292-8855409.jpg\",\n        \"userId\": \"69e76562713885bf5dbbe900\",\n        \"nutrients\": \"vitamin\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:16:14.355Z\",\n        \"updatedAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:28:46.768Z\",\n        \"total\": 900000,\n        \"__v\": 0\n    }\n]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#saerch-for-products","title":"Saerch for products","text":"<ul> <li> <p>endpoint: <code>http://localhost:4000/API/v1/animal-feeding/products/search?name=milk</code></p> </li> <li> <p>response: </p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>[\n    {\n        \"_id\": \"69e7c2cadd38d8d792cd3b77\",\n        \"name\": \"milk\",\n        \"description\": \"chakula cha ngombwe ambao wamezaliwa\",\n        \"quantity\": 20,\n        \"price\": 50000,\n        \"image\": \"/uploads/image-1776796362839-55022849.jpg\",\n        \"userId\": \"69e76562713885bf5dbbe900\",\n        \"nutrients\": \"vitamin\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:32:42.892Z\",\n        \"updatedAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:32:42.892Z\",\n        \"total\": 1000000,\n        \"__v\": 0\n    }\n]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#get-product","title":"get product","text":"<ul> <li> <p>endpoint: <code>http://localhost:4000/API/v1/animal-feeding/products/:id</code></p> </li> <li> <p>response: </p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>{\n    \"_id\": \"69e7c2cadd38d8d792cd3b77\",\n    \"name\": \"milk\",\n    \"description\": \"chakula cha ngombwe ambao wamezaliwa\",\n    \"quantity\": 20,\n    \"price\": 50000,\n    \"image\": \"/uploads/image-1776796362839-55022849.jpg\",\n    \"userId\": \"69e76562713885bf5dbbe900\",\n    \"nutrients\": \"vitamin\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:32:42.892Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:32:42.892Z\",\n    \"total\": 1000000,\n    \"__v\": 0\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#get-orders","title":"get orders","text":"<ul> <li> <p>endpoint: <code>http://localhost:4000/API/v1/animal-feeding/orders</code></p> </li> <li> <p>response: </p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>[\n    {\n        \"_id\": \"69e7c1deca1860a818857f78\",\n        \"productName\": \"lezod\",\n        \"productId\": {\n            \"_id\": \"69e7beee9e15259fba95973d\",\n            \"name\": \"lezod\"\n        },\n        \"quantity\": 1,\n        \"price\": 50000,\n        \"total\": 50000,\n        \"userId\": \"69e76562713885bf5dbbe900\",\n        \"orderId\": \"ORDER-ANIMAL-FEEDING-1776796126740-2277\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:28:46.748Z\",\n        \"updatedAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:28:46.748Z\",\n        \"__v\": 0\n    }\n]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#get-order","title":"get order","text":"<ul> <li> <p>endpoint: <code>http://localhost:4000/API/v1/animal-feeding/orders/:id</code></p> </li> <li> <p>response: </p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>{\n    \"_id\": \"69e7c1deca1860a818857f78\",\n    \"productName\": \"lezod\",\n    \"productId\": \"69e7beee9e15259fba95973d\",\n    \"quantity\": 1,\n    \"price\": 50000,\n    \"total\": 50000,\n    \"userId\": \"69e76562713885bf5dbbe900\",\n    \"orderId\": \"ORDER-ANIMAL-FEEDING-1776796126740-2277\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:28:46.748Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:28:46.748Z\",\n    \"__v\": 0\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#get-available-products","title":"get available products","text":"<ul> <li> <p>endpoint: <code>http://localhost:4000/API/v1/animal-feeding/available-products</code></p> </li> <li> <p>response: </p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>{\n    \"message\": \"Available products fetched successfully.\",\n    \"products\": [\n        {\n            \"_id\": \"69e7beee9e15259fba95973d\",\n            \"name\": \"lezod\",\n            \"description\": \"chakula cha ngombwe ambao wamezaliwa\",\n            \"quantity\": 18,\n            \"price\": 50000,\n            \"image\": \"/uploads/image-1776795374292-8855409.jpg\",\n            \"userId\": \"69e76562713885bf5dbbe900\",\n            \"nutrients\": \"vitamin\",\n            \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:16:14.355Z\",\n            \"updatedAt\": \"2026-04-21T18:28:46.768Z\",\n            \"total\": 900000,\n            \"__v\": 0\n        }\n    ]\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#get-revenue","title":"get revenue","text":"<ul> <li> <p>endpoint: <code>http://localhost:4000/api/v1/animal-feeding/revenue?period=day</code></p> </li> <li> <p>response body:</p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>{\n    \"message\": \"Day revenue fetched successfully.\",\n    \"revenue\": 100000,\n    \"period\": \"day\",\n    \"startDate\": \"2026-04-20T21:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"endDate\": \"2026-04-21T20:59:59.999Z\"\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#total-orders","title":"total orders","text":"<ul> <li> <p>endpoint: <code>http://localhost:4000/api/v1/animal-feeding/total-orders?filter=week</code></p> </li> <li> <p>response body:</p> </li> </ul> <pre><code>{\n    \"totalCost\": 100000\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#report","title":"Report","text":"<ul> <li> <p>This endpoint returns the report into the pdf format.</p> </li> <li> <p>endpoint: <code>http://localhost:4000/api/v1/animal-feeding/reports?startDate=2025-01-01&amp;endDate=2026-10-31</code></p> </li> </ul>"},{"location":"animalfeeding/#update","title":"Update","text":""},{"location":"animalfeeding/#delete","title":"Delete","text":""},{"location":"freshoil/","title":"Index","text":""},{"location":"freshoil/#animal-feeding-api-doc","title":"Animal Feeding API doc","text":""},{"location":"freshoil/#create","title":"Create","text":""},{"location":"freshoil/#read","title":"Read","text":""},{"location":"freshoil/#update","title":"Update","text":""},{"location":"freshoil/#delete","title":"Delete","text":""},{"location":"godown/","title":"Index","text":""},{"location":"godown/#animal-feeding-api-doc","title":"Animal Feeding API doc","text":""},{"location":"godown/#create","title":"Create","text":""},{"location":"godown/#read","title":"Read","text":""},{"location":"godown/#update","title":"Update","text":""},{"location":"godown/#delete","title":"Delete","text":""},{"location":"hardware/","title":"Index","text":""},{"location":"hardware/#animal-feeding-api-doc","title":"Animal Feeding API doc","text":""},{"location":"hardware/#create","title":"Create","text":""},{"location":"ha